  "prefLabel": "He-E 502.03 Confidentiality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 502.03 Confidentiality. All information on individuals receiving Title III services and programs administered by BAAS or a contract agency shall be kept confidential, and only persons involved in administering Title III services and programs shall review an individual’s information, unless the individual signs an authorization to release the information to another person or organization.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-E 502) #10530, eff 2-28-14; ss by #13354, eff 3-19-22",
